    "description": "<p>If the @Lookup[@name] isn't <em>Vulnerable</em>, <strong>spend a Fear</strong> to dive into a movable, inanimate object within Close range. Start a Possession Countdown (4). When the @Lookup[@name] would mark HP, instead tick down this countdown by the number of HP they would have marked. When it triggers, or the object is destroyed, the @Lookup[@name] is ejected from the object and becomes temporarily Vulnerable.</p>",
